  <data name="Controls_Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Touchpad
  Two-finger scroll sideways — turn the cloud
  Two-finger scroll up and down — tilt it
  Pinch — zoom

Mouse
  Drag — pan · Alt-drag or right-drag — orbit · Wheel — zoom

Photos
  Click — select and fly to it · Double-click — back to where you were
  Double-click empty space — the whole library · Click empty space — deselect

Keys
  Ctrl+F  Search · Ctrl+O  Add a folder · Ctrl+Alt+S  Sidebar
  Home  Fit · Alt+Left  Back · Esc  Deselect, then remove filter, then clear search
  1–5  Cloud, Colour, Time, Grid, Similarity · Arrows  Orbit · + −  Zoom · Space  Frame selection

Search reads what is in each photo with a local image model, and also matches titles, artists, materials and filenames.</value>
