  <data name="About_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Nebula for Windows</value>
  </data>
  <data name="About_Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Your collection, on your device.

Native WinUI and Direct3D. Cloud, Similarity, Colour, Time and Grid arrangements, search by what is in a photo, and favourites.

Search and Similarity run SigLIP 2 on this PC through Windows ML. No face recognition or location analysis.

No photo uploads. Originals remain unchanged. Favourites and appearance preferences are stored in LocalAppData\Nebula\Data, separately from your photos.</value>
